
### LAB 7 - JDBC & PostgreSQL
### Event Planner REST API


### GET - All events

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
Accept: application/json


### GET - Event by ID

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Accept: application/json


### GET - Event not found (404)

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/9999
Accept: application/json


### POST - Create event

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "PostgreSQL Workshop",
  "category": "Technology"
}


### PUT - Update event
### Replace the ID with the one returned by POST

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/5
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Advanced PostgreSQL Workshop",
  "category": "Database"
}


### DELETE - Remove event
### Replace the ID with the one returned by POST

DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/events/5
Accept: application/json




### GET - All event categories

GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Accept: application/json



### GET - Filter events by category

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?category=Technology
Accept: application/json


### GET - Filter events by another category

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?category=Education
Accept: application/json


### GET - Filter events by unknown category

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?category=Unknown
Accept: application/json


### GET - Events summary

GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/summary
Accept: application/json


### POST - Validation: blank name

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Technology"
}


### POST - Validation: name too short

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "AB",
  "category": "Technology"
}


### POST - Validation: blank category

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Java Conference",
  "category": ""
}


### PUT - Validation: invalid event

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/events/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Education"
}


### GET - Client information with custom header

GET http://localhost:8080/api/client-info
Accept: application/json
X-Client: IntelliJ


### GET - Client information without header

GET http://localhost:8080/api/client-info
Accept: application/json
